  "tag": "io1",
  "purpose": "SU lane cluster, pin-registered on BOTH faces (r7): the CLOSED OREG cluster qfd_su_lane_t_or-or1-2ae5f6ce3 fails the native pin audit on capture (665 input pins S+R 278..332 ps > 190 at R 715.8, rst_n 424.9; launch PASS 191.5) because the inputs ran straight to the closed head pins. IREG=1 adds one kept pin flop per input (valid bits reset by the parent reset register; the children reset from that register), ot_hdc_vstream LIREG=1 sends the five read requests over one fewer relay so the closed head read alignment is unchanged. Cost +1 edge per op (issue fields). Leaves NOT re-routed.",
